# VS Code. Kept out of version control deliberately: the editor config that
# was committed here was not this project's — it auto-ran a task on folder
# open, out of a file disguised as a font. Editor settings are a developer's
# own, and a repository that carries none cannot smuggle one.
.vscode/

# Not a web project. `public/` held a FontAwesome drop that nothing in the app
# referenced, which is what the auto-run task above was pointed at.
/public/

